# project: warehouse-wms-deployment
VAR clean_days = 0

-> migrate_pilot_aisle

=== migrate_pilot_aisle ===
Migrate the pilot aisle's inventory records to the new warehouse management system.
Done means records are migrated and reconciled against the old system.
~ clean_days = 0
+ [Records migrated and reconciled] -> pilot_cycle_counts

=== pilot_cycle_counts ===
Run picks and putaways for the pilot aisle on the new system and perform the daily cycle count.
Target: 99.5% inventory accuracy for five consecutive days; a miss resets the streak.
+ [Daily count hit 99.5%] -> record_clean_day
+ [Daily count missed 99.5%] -> reset_streak
+ [Pilot is stalling. Ops manager decides.] @human -> ops_review

=== record_clean_day ===
Log a clean day toward the five-day accuracy streak.
~ clean_days += 1
+ {clean_days < 5} [Streak continues; count again tomorrow] ~loop~ -> pilot_cycle_counts
+ {clean_days >= 5} [Five consecutive clean days] -> ops_review

=== reset_streak ===
A missed count resets the consecutive-day streak to zero.
~ clean_days = 0
+ [Resume daily counting] ~loop~ -> pilot_cycle_counts

=== ops_review ===
The ops manager reviews pilot results and decides how to proceed.
+ [Extend the pilot to another aisle] @human ~loop~ -> migrate_pilot_aisle
+ [Green-light the full warehouse] @human -> freeze_check

=== freeze_check ===
Absolute constraint: nothing changes during the peak-season freeze from November through January.
If we are not live before the freeze, the whole thing waits for February.
+ [Freeze has not started; proceed to cutover] -> full_migration_weekend
+ [Freeze window reached; hold until February] -> wait_for_february

=== wait_for_february ===
Hold all changes through peak season; the old system keeps running untouched.
+ [February arrives; freeze lifted] -> full_migration_weekend

=== full_migration_weekend ===
Migrate the full warehouse to the new system over one weekend.
-> monday_verification

=== monday_verification ===
Assess Monday morning's operations on the new system.
+ [Operations normal] -> stabilization_month
+ [Operations degraded] -> rollback

=== rollback ===
Roll back to the old system; the warehouse resumes on the legacy WMS.
+ [Ops manager schedules a retry] @human ~loop~ -> freeze_check

=== stabilization_month ===
Run the full warehouse on the new system with the old system on standby.
Done means one clean month of operations with no rollback-worthy issues.
+ [Issues found; restart the clean-month clock] ~loop~ -> stabilization_month
* [Clean month complete] -> decommission_old_system

=== decommission_old_system ===
Retire the old warehouse management system.
-> END
